(    Manager-->>Main: SimulationManagerReport) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 645.0 Tm
/F2 13 Tf
(Design Decisions) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 620.0 Tm
/F2 11 Tf
(1. Self-Contained NPY I/O \(No TinyNPY Dependency\)) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 605.0 Tm
(We implement our own minimal NpyArray class that reads/writes the .npy format directly. This) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 591.0 Tm
(eliminates an external dependency while remaining fully compatible with NumPy's output.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 570.0 Tm
/F2 11 Tf
(2. MockMovement Includes Collision Detection) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 555.0 Tm
(Unlike the skeleton stub, MockMovement::advance\(\) and elevate\(\) check the hidden map for) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 541.0 Tm
(obstacles along the path. This prevents the drone from flying through walls, which would make) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 527.0 Tm
(the simulation physically invalid.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 506.0 Tm
/F2 11 Tf
(3. BFS Exploration Algorithm) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 491.0 Tm
(MappingAlgorithmImpl uses a breadth-first exploration strategy:) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 477.0 Tm
(1. Initial scan: at the starting position, emit 10 scan directions \(8 horizontal + up/down\)) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 463.0 Tm
(2. Queue neighbors: after each scan, queue all unmapped adjacent voxels) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 449.0 Tm
(3. Navigate: BFS pathfinding to the next frontier voxel) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 435.0 Tm
(4. Rescan: on arrival at a new position, scan again) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 421.0 Tm
(5. Terminate: when the frontier is exhausted \(no reachable unmapped voxels\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 400.0 Tm
/F2 11 Tf
(4. ScanResultToVoxels \(Provided Algorithm\)) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 385.0 Tm
(The ScanResultToVoxels::applyToMap\(\) method \(adapted from the course skeleton\) converts LiDAR) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 371.0 Tm
